{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras/title-image.png?t=1742639480\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Luna and the Sea</strong> is a beautifully hand-drawn-style, story-driven <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong> set in <strong>17th-century Amsterdam</strong>. You play as <strong>Luna</strong>, a young girl surviving alone on the streets, who embarks on a journey across the sea to find her long-lost father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only her wits and kindness, Luna navigates a world that is both cruel and wondrous, encountering characters who are struggling just like her. Every choice matters\u2014will you help those in need, or look out only for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This first chapter introduces players to Luna\u2019s world, where <strong>puzzles, exploration, and heartfelt storytelling</strong> blend seamlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A rich narrative adventure</strong> \u2013 Experience a heartwarming yet bittersweet story about hope, loss, and resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles, interact with unique characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/