que characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Voidance"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/41b380ca607bf83e4ce6882b3b737374c5790209/header.jpg?t=1742639480","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10 and newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111959,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111959/movie480.mp4?t=1741959964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111959/movie_max.mp4?t=1741959964"},"name":"Luna and the Sea - trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111959/d977e3dc1e77f1c13d0e52d8ef0191023b4fb51a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741959964","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111959/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741959964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111959/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741959964"}},{"highligh